---
title: 灰度发布与流量回滚
---
flowchart TD
    deploy([部署候选版])
    subgraph rollout [灰度放量]
        引流[接入 5% 流量] --> observe[/观察 5 分钟/]
        observe --> 错率{错误率 ≤ 1%？}
        错率 -->|达标| 全量{已达全量？}
        全量 -->|未到| ramp[提高流量比例]
        ramp --> observe
    end
    deploy --> 引流
    全量 -->|已全量| keep([保留新版])
    错率 -->|超限| rollback[切回旧版]
    rollback --> freeze([冻结本次发布])

    classDef release stroke:#6ee7b7
    classDef recovery stroke:#fb7185
    class deploy,keep release
    class rollback,freeze recovery
    style rollout stroke:#7dd3fc
    linkStyle 5,6 stroke:#6ee7b7,color:#6ee7b7
    linkStyle 7,8 stroke:#fb7185,color:#fb7185
